---1463811840-1410486745-1061287812=:28761
Content-Type: TEXT/PLAIN; charset=US-ASCII

Hi Harald,
these are the patches we just talked about, everything is compile-tested,
some are runtime-tested. Hope i didn't break anything by pom-ifying them.
I decided to drop the skb->len patch for now.

Short description:

- pom-2.{4,6}-owner-supgids.diff:
Support matching supplementary gids in owner match

- pom-2.4-conntrack-macros.diff
Don't pass hash_conntrack to LIST_* (should apply to 2.4 & 2.6)

- pom-2.{4,6}-memsets.diff
Remove unneccasary memsets

- pom-2.4-nat_h-unused-var.diff
Remove unused variable from ip_nat_info (should apply to 2.4 & 2.6)

- pom-2.4-nat_tftp-compiler-warning.diff
Fix compiler warning in ip_nat_tftp

- pom-2.6-err-ptr.diff
Use err.h for ERR_PTR instead of fs.h

Patrick

